#: README.md:2
msgid ""
"This guide is designed to provide users with practical advice on using the "
"hySAS module. For theoretical information about the method, please refer to "
"the related "
"[manuscript](https://pubs.acs.org/doi/full/10.1021/acs.jctc.3c00864). The "
"guide is divided into several sections:"
msgstr ""
"hySAS の実践的な使い方を説明します。理論は関連 "
"[論文](https://pubs.acs.org/doi/full/10.1021/acs.jctc.3c00864) "
"を参照してください。次の節があります。"

#: README.md:4
msgid "hySAS Intro & Overview"
msgstr "hySAS の導入と概要"

#: README.md:5
msgid ""
"A brief introduction to the method, basic concepts, and an overview of the "
"analyses that can be performed."
msgstr "手法、基本概念、可能な解析の簡単な紹介。"

#: README.md:7
msgid "Determining the Scattering Profile with hySAS"
msgstr "hySAS による Scattering Profile の決定"

#: README.md:8
msgid ""
"From coordinates to a SAS curve: steps and examples to analyse a PDB file or"
" a trajectory."
msgstr "座標から SAS Curve へ：PDB・Trajectory 解析の手順と例。"

#: README.md:10
msgid "Generating a Conformational Ensemble with GMX and hySAS"
msgstr "GMX と hySAS による Conformational Ensemble の生成"

